 ## Respond to Size Changes
 
-### traitCollectionDidChange
+### registerForTraitChanges (iOS 17+)
+
+`traitCollectionDidChange(_:)` is deprecated since iOS 17. Register for the one trait you need instead, once (in `init` or `awakeFromNib`):
+
+```swift
+registerForTraitChanges([UITraitPreferredContentSizeCategory.self], action: #selector(updateLayout))
+```
+
+The action method must be `@objc`.
+
+The `traitCollectionDidChange(_:)` overrides in the examples below are for apps that still support iOS 16 or earlier; on iOS 17+ replace them with the registration above.
+
+### traitCollectionDidChange (before iOS 17)
 
